# Optional. The site needs no environment to run: contract addresses and the
# list of markets come from public/data/addresses.json, written by
# build_feed_data.py from shared/addresses.json. Copy this to .env.local
# only to override something. The RPC endpoints are fixed in lib/contracts.ts
# (XLAYER_TESTNET_RPC_URLS) and are not overridable.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_USDT_ADDRESS=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
#
# Never put a private key or an API key in the web environment: every
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* value is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
